 from the files currently on disk; the unmodified originals are in pf8_ghana_pipeline.zip. The accidental truncation recorded in the note above is a direct consequence of this gap. (iii) UMAP with a fixed random_state is single-threaded and deterministic, but t-SNE has not been verified to be bitwise reproducible across thread counts.
